{"card_id": "rc29", "scene_id": "rc29_s17", "pipeline": "minicpm5-official", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512, "mode": "official", "server_side": "server :8091 flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42；请求只传 temperature=1.0/max_tokens"}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我今天特别难过，感觉没人理解我。", "user_text_gt": "我今天特别难过，感觉没人理解我。", "assistant_text": "我理解这种感受。每个人都有自己的情绪波动，就像星空偶尔会黯淡。记住，情绪只是暂时的。当你感到孤独时，可以轻轻推开一扇窗，望向更广阔的天空。哪怕只是片刻的宁静，也能让心情慢慢舒展。不必独自承担，允许自己感受，然后悄悄地将这些情绪化作流动的星光。", "latency_s": 0.965, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc29_s17_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你会安慰人吗？", "user_text_gt": "你会安慰人吗？", "assistant_text": "会。", "latency_s": 0.115, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc29_s17_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.081}
{"card_id": "rc29", "scene_id": "rc29_s20", "pipeline": "minicpm5-official", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512, "mode": "official", "server_side": "server :8091 flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42；请求只传 temperature=1.0/max_tokens"}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你好啊，影郎。", "user_text_gt": "你好啊，银狼。", "assistant_text": "影郎。听我说——这世界本就该如此。你还觉得这丝绒大衣不够轻盈？那是因为你忘了，力量才是最好的布料。拉琴时指尖的颤抖，才是最高雅的韵律。", "latency_s": 0.679, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc29_s20_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "啊，抱歉，我认错了。你是谁来着？", "user_text_gt": "啊抱歉，我认错了，你是谁来着？", "assistant_text": "哦，误了。卡芙卡——星核猎手的副手，来自新巴比伦的阴影与优雅。听说你从丝绒里寻到了宁静？可别忘了，温柔与暴力同样锋利。听我说……（轻轻拢了拢宽大的衣摆）你还需要别的什么吗？", "latency_s": 0.894, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc29_s20_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.573}
